The residual forward/backward arcs, negative-cycle search and augmentation in
circulation.ts adapt packages/solver/src/circulation.ts from Setoff at commit
3f335379142ff8a0278219786624737017884c62.
https://github.com/Elioz404/Setoff/blob/3f335379142ff8a0278219786624737017884c62/packages/solver/src/circulation.ts

Razor adds a conserved baseline seed, deterministic ordering, fixed work bounds,
capacity validation and execution metadata. No upstream application or financial
authority is adopted.

